.superpowers/
# Default ALEXANDRIA_HTTP_CACHE location (src/utils/dispatcher.ts): the
# undici RFC 9111 http-cache SQLite database, created at runtime. Also the
# default ALEXANDRIA_STATE_DB location (src/utils/stateStore.ts): the
# quota ledger + result cache SQLite database.
/data/
# ALEXANDRIA_CATALOG_CACHE default and model-specific variants
# (src/utils/catalogIndex.ts): the catalog embedding cache, created at
# runtime by `npm run eval:routing` when an embeddings role is configured.
/eval/catalog-embeddings*.json
# scripts/probe.ts's per-run output (the weekly probe workflow uploads it
# as an artifact and diffs it against eval/probe-baseline.json, which stays
# checked in); a local `npm run probe` shouldn't dirty the tree.
/eval/probe-latest.json
